{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:04 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"3639010\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59266fe8b192d78be77d22efc1a68c9e/2026-11/2026_1__0.png\"/>\n<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》於今晚（19日）在將軍澳電視廣播城舉行，其中由陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚及陳敏之領軍的「炫舞女王」表演，成為全晚矚目焦點。30位 TVB 女藝員在台上施展渾身解數，中途多次變裝，性感舞衣相當吸睛。當中現年52歲的陳煒雖然在隊中形同大姐大，但她保養得宜且活力十足，展現出成熟嫵媚的女性魅力，一舉手一投足都令人目不轉睛！</p>\n<h2>30位靚女表演「炫舞女王」</h2>\n<p>「炫舞女王」的30位成員包括陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之、關嘉敏、黃嘉雯、古佩玲、王菲、葉蒨文、李芷晴、梁超怡、陳嘉慧、陳熙蕊、曾文心、賴彥妤、劉嘉琪、趙璧渝、莊易羚、王汛文、黃婧靈、曹銦玲、鐘翠詩、鄧凱文、蔡華英、李尹嫣、黃瀅仴、朱文慧、鄧美欣、許苡琳及蕭麗艾，她們在台上的投入演出非常值得讚賞。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳煒領軍表演「炫舞女王」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c5dfeb9154c920a638c3e57d4dc58ec/2026-11/1_4_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9f82c156c888584dc664eb2fb4093d69/2026-11/2_0_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒和另外29位美女藝員表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ca0b5a93e1912f82d0ebd0ff3c2a79b/2026-11/3_3_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之成「炫舞女王」環節主角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56002ddb4572d7e5512f5dfe4c2153e9/2026-11/4_1_5.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之極吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e4e1cad6920fdfb2c6ede64d215019e/2026-11/5_1_4.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d92720115d3affe930d9e7804db867d7/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918200_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8754b623a9886693b29a3573e9a6b05b/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918200_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58b613f122b1bd7b42656fb9900953d5/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918200_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/746873cd0ef8781989736a87107db42b/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918201_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b429a83d23d9ab0012348b49b7d27f33/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918201_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd94c2d957976f878d7dbe0aed9a9c97/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918201_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/270cd252ed07eb5bd991e6ad2c9b61bf/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918201_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/915f0a2c1d592ccef06f23aeaa93dc45/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918202_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47121032ab3055c6c562eab4bc7ecd59/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918202_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44f66d4edb26012be5b778c58be43815/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918204_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/baf04ca3c1ef8ef8dffd7a8f096ad400/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918204_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59935d1f882dd69bf6fbffbf4cafad23/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918205_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e2047fde4ba9ad5a7b1a881c1752086/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918205_46_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dee60fe2cb2882659c7b43e89fb8bbb3/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918205_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f32469859c903bc33214fecc097dd04/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918205_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2fe63574730f5f894fae1715deedd72/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918206_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54933b8375200e184c51fadc0521019c/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918206_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4823fa259d7b5d47b7b2e4c4d311bdae/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918207_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34d93b5d3d1c5cb88ec56ed4d3c3cb3c/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918207_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f47ad01fb9e9b52a1388116f4d81855/2026-11/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29918207_40_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳煒完美致敬梅艷芳</h2>\n<p>四位領軍藝員成為表演主力，並由陳煒壓軸出場。她於台上拉開皮褸拉鏈，棗紅色低胸內搭舞衣大秀健美身段，氣場十足。她將長髮紮起，野性造型被指是向已故歌后梅艷芳的經典作品〈烈焰紅唇〉致敬。此外，傅嘉莉穿上黑絲襪大跳椅子舞，姚子羚的拐杖舞亦極具觀賞性，而擁有「長腿天后」美譽的陳敏之則以超短褲上陣，表演時更去到盡「碌地沙」，一雙招牌長腿非常矚目。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.514645+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":537,"images":26,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:04:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:36.951120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:36.951120+00:00","content_hash":"633f447de5c212ecd1a83257e4f5f85266524a392b133d4632d54447f0fe4c96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}